      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.mark.bohairic_ed:6",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲛⲉⲛⲧⲁⲩⲙⲟⲩ ⲅⲁⲣ ϩⲙⲡϩⲟϫϩϫ ⲛⲙⲙⲏⲏϣⲉ · ⲉⲩⲛⲁⲣϯⲟⲩ ⲛ**ϣⲟ** · ⲭⲱⲣⲓⲥⲛⲉⲛⲧⲁⲩⲙⲟⲩ ϩⲙⲡⲣⲡⲉ · ⲉⲩⲛⲁⲣⲕⲉϥⲧⲟⲟⲩϣⲉ ·",
      "english": "And those who died through being^ crushed by the multitudes were five thousand in number, in addi tion to those who died in the temple, who were also five thousand in number, excepting the ones who died in the temple.",
